    {
      "id": "u5-theory-1",
      "type": "theory",
      "title": "L'impératif (Повелительное наклонение)",
      "content": "<p style='margin-bottom:1rem'>Повелительное наклонение образуется от формы настоящего времени для <strong>tu, nous, vous</strong>, без местоимения.</p><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0'><tr><th style='padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Лицо</th><th style='padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>aller</th><th style='padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>prendre</th><th style='padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>tourner</th></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>tu</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa'>Va !</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa'>Prends !</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa'>Tourne !</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>nous</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#34d399'>Allons !</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#34d399'>Prenons !</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#34d399'>Tournons !</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>vous</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#c084fc'>Allez !</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#c084fc'>Prenez !</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#c084fc'>Tournez !</td></tr></table><p style='padding:1rem;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);border-radius:8px'>⚠️ У глаголов на -ER в форме <strong>tu</strong> нет окончания -s:<br>• <em>tu tournes</em> → Impératif: <em>Tourne !</em> (не «tournes»)</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "u5-theory-2",
      "type": "theory",
      "title": "Les verbes ALLER et VENIR",
      "content": "<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem'><div><h4 style='color:#60a5fa;margin-bottom:0.5rem'>ALLER (идти/ехать)</h4><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse'><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>je</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>vais</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>tu</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>vas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>il/elle</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>va</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>nous</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>allons</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>vous</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>allez</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>ils</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#60a5fa;font-weight:bold'>vont</td></tr></table></div><div><h4 style='color:#34d399;margin-bottom:0.5rem'>VENIR (приходить)</h4><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse'><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>je</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#34d399;font-weight:bold'>viens</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>tu</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#34d399;font-weight:bold'>viens</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>il/elle</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#34d399;font-weight:bold'>vient</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>nous</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#34d399;font-weight:bold'>venons</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>vous</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#34d399;font-weight:bold'>venez</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.3rem'>ils</td><td style='padding:0.3rem;color:#34d399;font-weight:bold'>viennent</td></tr></table></div></div><p style='margin-top:1rem;padding:1rem;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);border-radius:8px'>💡 Aller + инфинитив = <strong>ближайшее будущее</strong>:<br>• <em>Je <strong>vais</strong> partir.</em> — Я собираюсь уехать. (скоро)</p>"
    },
